korf_1, korf_12 and korf_55 are the instances 1, 12 and 55 of korf100.txt
in the format of E. Burns, S. Lemons, W. Ruml and R. Zhou, "Best-first
heuristic search for multicore machines", JAIR 39, 2010, which gives the
cell of each tile [see SlidingTile::read_positions() in
include/PBeFS/astar/SlidingTile.h], from src/tiles of
